          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Schwinn 830</h3>
          <p>
            TreadmillReviews.com and Garage Gym Reviews agree on a 2.75 continuous horsepower motor, a 20 by 55-inch
            running area, 12 mph, 0 to 12% incline, a 300 lb user rating, 22 programs and a hydraulic fold.
            TreadmillReviews.com lists a 10-year frame, two-year mechanical and one-year electrical and labour warranty,
